1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,888
The Reimer Tiemann reaction.

2
00:00:01,888 --> 00:00:07,994
Warm phenol with chloroform and sodium hydroxide at sixty to seventy degrees.

3
00:00:07,994 --> 00:00:17,343
The alkali pulls hydrogen chloride out of chloroform, creating dichlorocarbene, a neutral carbon with only six electrons.

4
00:00:17,343 --> 00:00:21,132
It is electron hungry, a weak electrophile.

